ilver, and once again, when they met, the match ended in a draw."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The bronze medal in 1964 went to German " [:a {:href "/athletes/58341"} "Wilfried Dietrich"] ", who had won the silver medal in this class in 1956 and 1960. Dietrich was competing in his third Olympics and this was his fourth medal. He would compete again in 1968 and 1972, winning a bronze medal in 1968 in freestyle heavyweight, his fifth medal, which remains, through 2012, an Olympic best for wrestling."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Round Eliminated"] [:th {} "Bad Points"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "9"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58599"} "István Kozma"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/HUN"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/HUN.png"}] "HUN"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "6"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60520"} "Anatoly Roshchin"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "3"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/58341"} "Wilfried Dietrich"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GER"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GER.png"}] "GER"]] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "7"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/60199"} "Petr Kment"]] [: